  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-31T14:58:38.828Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I'd like to request the ability to replace the AudioListener \n component of the player object. \nBy replacing I mean providing a different AudioListener component which can be somewhere else in a world. When provided it would disable the player audio listener and be the source of everything the player hears. \nReason being: I am currently overriding the entire player view and it isn't easily possible to make the player hear anything with correct spatialization from the position/orientation of the view-overriding camera.\nAdditionally it would be nice to be able to disable the player camera when it is being overridden anyway.",
